**Tab: MySQL**

MySQL uses **binlog position** for global state tracking to maintain the replication position across all streams.

```json title="state.json (MySQL)"
{
  "type": "STREAM",
  "version": 1,
  "global": {
    "state": {
      "server_id": 261398335,
      "state": {
        "position": {
          "Name": "mysql-bin.000070",
          "Pos": 811746
        }
      }
